  "contract": "The Ascension PvP window's Rated SoloQ 2v2 button sends 0x05C1 with bracket 2 and the chosen role (healer 0x04, damage 0x08). Each solo player joins the rated 2v2 queue with a personal one-member 2v2 arena team, not the skirmish queue. Two healers and two damage dealers are matched into one rated arena with a healer on each side; with equal matchmaking ratings the earlier damage dealer joins the first healer's side. When one side dies after the gates open, every participant's personal 2v2 team records one season game, and only the winners record a season win.",
